    "description": "This lot includes a foam display tray with 19 labeled glass cork-top vials filled with tumbled chip stones such as Jade, Lapis Lazuli, Smoky Quartz, Aquamarine, Rhodonite, Fluorite, Amethyst, Red Jasper, and Clear Quartz. Additional specimens include two quartz geode halves, a rough pink tourmaline cluster, raw amethyst, agate slices, a polished citrine/quartz tumble, an onyx slab, a jasper nugget, and various unpolished rock chunks in gray, green, white, and black tones. Also featured is a green aventurine gua sha stone and a decorative silver-tone spoon with a carved green stone handle. The pieces show natural wear consistent with mineral specimens and some contain dirt or matrix residue typical of raw stones.",
